+extends RefCounted
+## ADR1155: observer-free whole-World lifetime handshake. No store is cleared and no gameplay permission is granted.
+## Host mount ownership/admission-stop is a caller obligation; host/Session arguments are identity pins only.
+
+const World := preload("res://scripts/core/world_init.gd")
